// Local signing, for building to a device or archiving.
//
// Copy this file to Signing.xcconfig in the same directory and fill in your
// own Apple Developer team id (ten characters, shown under Membership on
// developer.apple.com). Signing.xcconfig is ignored by git; a team id never
// belongs in the repository.
//
// The alternative is the environment: export HERMIE_TEAM_ID before running
// xcodebuild and leave this file alone. A value set here wins over the
// environment.
//
// Neither is needed for the simulator or for an unsigned Mac build
// (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO).
//
// A fork ships under its own bundle id as well: override
// PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER here, and change the App Group and keychain group
// in both App/*.entitlements to match.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TEAM_ID
